"slug": "match-tree", "storyline": "It's a match tree game. A fresh approach. Meet the Pixie, the Gnome and the Witch and build them homes.\n\nYou combine flowers, carrots and trees.\nBut be aware of the SHEEP!\n\nThe fairy leaves new flowers on every location she touches.\n\nYou can win, when you create the needed object (shown on the upper center)\nSome maps have events that get triggered by the points you collect while matching.\n\nIt's a game we tinker with and updating regularly.", "summary": "Match Tree is a breathtaking puzzle experience (...it's actually a match 3 game).\nEmbark on an epic journey with pixie, gnome and witch full of adventure, mystery (huh?) and sheep.\nBecome the master of combination and create magnificent mansions from trees, flowers and carrots (I swear, it's fun!).", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/match-tree"}